{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>For if Kain is to be consumed, how long until Ashur carries you captive.</b> That is to say: how long will Ashur carry you captive — it will not leave you, if you are for destruction. And אשור is feminine in form, and its sense is 'the camp of Ashur,' as in (Job 1:15) ״ותפול שבא״, and similarly (I Samuel 17) ״ותערוך ישראל״."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:35:48.771693287Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}